.TH "DNF-SHOW-LEAVES" "8" "Jan 22, 2023" "4.3.1" "dnf-plugins-core"
.SH NAME
dnf-show-leaves \- DNF show-leaves Plugin
.sp
Shows newly installed leaf packages and packages that became leaves
after a transaction.
.sp
For more information about leaf packages, see documentation for the
\fBleaves\fP DNF plugin.
